props.description:
The open / closed indicator at the inline end. Default: one chevron that turns over while the panel is open
(`aria-expanded`), which draws exactly the down / up pair it replaced. A node replaces it (a plus, a caret;
style its open state with `group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:`); `null` draws none.

