exports.description:
A star rating. Every `Rating.Root` prop passes through (`value` / `defaultValue` / `onValueChange`, `max` default 5,
`allowHalf`, `clearable`, `readOnly`, `disabled`, `name`, `getItemLabel`); `size` is `sm`, `md` (default) or `lg`;
`icon` swaps the star. Give it an accessible name (`aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`).
